WEBVTT

00:13:29.197 --> 00:13:32.530
Their real world, with all their gods
and magical forces,

00:13:32.563 --> 00:13:34.997
were just as real as our own.

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:37.897
Indeed, those real worlds

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:44.463
anchored ways of life that sustained
the lives of multitudes

00:13:44.463 --> 00:13:47.730
for hundreds, sometimes
thousands, of years.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:50.330
Their real worlds were different;

00:13:50.363 --> 00:13:51.930
they were not wrong.

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:54.430
Second:

00:13:55.597 --> 00:13:58.297
we modern Westerners
need to get over ourselves.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.863
(Laughter)

00:13:59.863 --> 00:14:02.063
We need to be a little more humble.